rectedGraph","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix","url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix"}}}